This project adapts the multi-agent methodology and agent role prompts of
TradingAgents (https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents),
Copyright Tauric Research, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original: re-implemented as an agent skill (SKILL.md + subagent
prompt files) instead of a LangGraph application; added a deterministic Python data
layer (yfinance), portfolio-aware context (holdings, FX normalization, concentration,
options exposure), a 5-way action space (BUY/ADD/HOLD/TRIM/SELL) with sizing/exit
contract, and a self-grading decisions ledger.
